ule without the WooCommerce plugin active) cannot be enabled at all.','Newline-separated list of domains to nofollow. If empty, nofollow applies to all external domains (when enabled). Only takes effect when nofollow_external_links or nofollow_image_links is also enabled — hidden in the UI otherwise.'=>'Newline-separated list of domains to nofollow. If empty, nofollow applies to all external domains (when enabled). Only takes effect when nofollow_external_links or nofollow_image_links is also enabled — hidden in the UI otherwise.','Automatically add rel="nofollow" to links pointing to external image files.'=>'Automatically add rel="nofollow" to links pointing to external image files.','Automatically add target="_blank" to external links in content.'=>'Automatically add target="_blank" to external links in content.','Automatically add rel="nofollow" to external links in content.'=>'Automatically add rel="nofollow" to external links in content.','Updates site-wide link behavior: nofollow for external and image links, opening external links in a new tab, nofollow domain allow/exclude lists, category base stripping, and attachment page redirects. All fields are optional — omitted fields keep their current stored value.'=>'Updates site-wide link behaviour: nofollow for external and image links, opening external links in a new tab, nofollow domain allow/exclude lists, category base stripping, and attachment page redirects. All fields are optional — omitted fields keep their current stored value.','Set link settings'=>'Set link settings','show_on_front is set to "page" but no front page is assigned (page_on_front is empty). Assign a static front page under WP Dashboard > Settings > Reading.'=>'show_on_front is set to "page" but no front page is assigned (page_on_front is empty). Assign a static front page under WP Dashboard > Settings > Reading.','No fields provided. Pass at least one of: title, description, focus_keyword.'=>'No fields provided. Pass at least one of: title