is displayed only to administrators. Site visitors are redirected without delay.','<strong>Edit</strong> redirection details: from/to URLs and the redirection type.'=>'<strong>Edit</strong> redirection details: from/to URLs and the redirection type.','<strong>Activate/Deactivate</strong> redirections. Deactivated redirections do not take effect on your site.'=>'<strong>Activate/Deactivate</strong> redirections. Deactivated redirections do not take effect on your site.','<strong>Delete</strong> permanently removes the redirection.'=>'<strong>Delete</strong> permanently removes the redirection.','You can also activate, deactivate, or delete multiple items at once using the Bulk Actions dropdown.'=>'You can also activate, deactivate, or delete multiple items simultaneously using the Bulk Actions dropdown.','Here you can set up custom redirections. It is important to choose the right type of redirection.'=>'Here you can set up custom redirections. It is important to choose the right type of redirection.','Default 404'=>'Default 404','Redirect to Homepage'=>'Redirect to Homepage','Custom Redirection'=>'Custom Redirection','Custom Url '=>'Custom URL  ','Auto Post Redirect'=>'Auto Post Redirect','Extend the functionality of WordPress by creating redirects in our plugin when you change the slug of a post, page, category or a CPT. You can modify the redirection further according to your needs.'=>'Extend the functionality of WordPress by creating redirects in our plugin when you change the slug of a post, page, category or CPT. You can modify the redirection further according to your needs.','Headline'=>'Headline','Phone'=>'Phone','Search engines may prominently display your contact phone number for mobile users.'=>'Search engines may prominently display your contact phone number for mobile users.','Address'=>'Address','Address Format'=>'Address Format','Format used when the address is displayed using the <code>[rank_math_contact_info]</code> shortcode.<br><strong>Available Tags: {address}, {locality}, {region}, {postalcode}, {country}, {gps}</strong>'=>'Format used when the address is displayed using the <code>[rank_math_contact_info]</code> shortcode.<br><strong>Available Tags: {address}, {locality}, {region}, {postalcode}, {country}, {gps}</strong>','Opening Hours'=>'Opening Hours','Select opening hours. You can add multiple sets if you have different opening or closing hours on some days or if you have a mid-day break. Times are specified using 24:00 time.'=>'Select opening hours. You can add multiple sets if you have different opening or closing hours on some days or if you have a midday break. Times are specified using 24:00 time.','Add time'=>'Add time','Monday'=>'Monday','No redirections added yet. <a href="#" class="rank-math-add-new-redirection">Add New Redirection</a>'=>'No redirections added yet. <a href="#" class="rank-math-add-new-redirection">Add New Redirection</a>','Show more'=>'Show more','Hide details'=>'Hide details','Hide'=>'Hide','Delete Permanently'=>'Delete Permanently','Edit'=>'Edit','Trash'=>'Bin','From'=>'From','To'=>'To','Type'=>'Type','Author'=>'Author','Edition'=>'Edition','ISBN'=>'ISBN','Course Provider URL'=>'Course Provider URL','Event Type'=>'Event Type','Venue Name'=>'Venue Name','Venue URL'=>'Venue URL','Event Status'=>'Event Status','Availability'=>'Availability','Availability Starts'=>'Availability Starts','Stock Inventory'=>'Stock Inventory','Expiry Posted'=>'Expiry Posted','Unpublish when expired'=>'Unpublish when expired','Opening Time'=>'Opening Time','Closing Time'=>'Closing Time','Product SKU'=>'Product SKU','Product Brand'=>'Product Brand','Product Currency'=>'Product Currency','Total Time'=>'Total Time','Recipe Video Thumbnail'=>'Recipe Video Thumbnail','Recipe Video Name'=>'Recipe Video Name','Recipe Instructions'=>'Recipe Instructions','Serves Cuisine'=>'Serves Cuisine','Menu URL'=>'Menu URL','Price Currency'=>'Price Currency','Operating System'=>'Operating System','Application Category'=>'Application Category','Service Type'=>'Service Type','Total Keywords'=>'Total Keywords','Total Clicks'=>'Total Clicks','Total Impressions'=>'Total Impressions','Average Position'=>'Average Position','Items'=>'Items','Site-wide analysis'=>'Site-wide analysis','Analyze this Page'=>'Analyse this Page','SEO Analysis for this page'=>'SEO Analysis for this page','Site Tagline'=>'Site Tagline','Your theme may display the Site Tagline, and it can also be used in SEO titles &amp; descriptions. Set it to something unique. You can change it by navigating to <a href="%s">Settings &gt; General</a>.'=>'Your theme may display the Site Tagline, and it can also be used in SEO titles &amp; descriptions. Set it to something unique. You can change it by navigating to <a href="%s">Settings &gt; General</a>.','Most WordPress themes place your site\'s tagline in a prominent position (inside header tags near the top of the page).  Using the right tagline can give your site an SEO boost.'=>'Most WordPress themes place your site\'s tagline in a prominent position (inside header tags near the top of the page). Using the right tagline can give your site an SEO boost.','Setting focus keywords for your posts allows Rank Math to analyse the content.'=>'Setting focus keywords for your posts allows Rank Math to analyse the content.','Rank Math allows you to set a focus keyword for every post and page you write - the option is in the "Meta Box", which appears under the text editor in the screen where you write and edit content.'=>'Rank Math allows you to set a focus keyword for every post and page you write - the option is in the "Meta Box", which appears under the text editor in the screen where you write and edit content.','Rank Math uses these focus keywords to analyze your on-page content.  It can tell if you\'ve done a good job of optimizing your text to rank for these keywords.'=>'Rank Math uses these focus keywords to analyse your on-page content. It can tell if you\'ve done a good job of optimising your text to rank for these keywords.','Of course, if you don\'t give Rank Math a focus keyword to work with, it can\'t give you any useful feedback.'=>'Of course, if you don\'t give Rank Math a focus keyword to work with, it can\'t give you any useful feedback.','Fixing this issue is easy - just edit the post, and set a Focus Keyword.  Then follow Rank Math\'s analysis to improve your rankings.'=>'Fixing this issue is easy - just edit the post, and set a Focus Keyword. Then follow Rank Math\'s analysis to improve your rankings.','Post Titles Missing Focus Keywords'=>'Post Titles Missing Focus Keywords','Make sure the focus keywords you set for the posts appear in their titles.'=>'Make sure the focus keywords you set for the posts appear in their titles.','HTML Page Titles play a large role in Google\'s ranking algorithm.  When you add a Focus Keyword to a post or page, Rank Math will check to see that you used the keyword in the title.  If it finds any posts or pages that are missing the keyword in the title, it will tell you here.'=>'HTML Page Titles play a large role in Google\'s ranking algorithm. When you add a Focus Keyword to a post or page, Rank Math will check to see that you used the keyword in the title. If it finds any posts or pages that are missing the keyword in the title, it will tell you here.','Fixing the issue is simple - just edit the post/page and add the focus keyword(s) to the title.'=>'Fixing the issue is simple - just edit the post/page and add the focus keyword(s) to the title.','Register at Google Search Console and verificate your site by adding the code to <a href="%1$s">Settings &gt; Verificate Tools</a>, then navigate to <a href="%2$s">Settings &gt; Search Console</a> to authenticate and link your site.'=>'Register at Google Search Console and verify your site by adding the code to <a href="%1$s">Settings &gt; Verification Tools</a>, then navigate to <a href="%2$s">Settings &gt; Search Console</a> to authenticate and link your site.','Google Search Console has been linked.'=>'Google Search Console has been linked.','You have not linked Google Search Console yet.'=>'You have not linked Google Search Console yet.','All published posts have focus keywords set.'=>'All published posts have focus keywords set.','There are %s with no focus keyword set.'=>'There are %s with no focus keyword set.','Focus keywords appear in the titles of published posts where it is set.'=>'Focus keywords appear in the titles of published posts where it is set.','+%d More...'=>'+%d More...','Your site has one or more sitemaps.'=>'Your site has one or more sitemaps.','No sitemaps found.'=>'No sitemaps found.','single %s'=>'single %s','Sitemap URL: %s'=>'Sitemap URL: %s','Please note that this will add the attachment page URLs to the sitemap, not direct image URLs.'=>'Please note that this will add the attachment page URLs to the sitemap, not direct image URLs.','Taxonomies:'=>'Taxonomies:','your product %s pages'=>'your product %s pages','%s archives'=>'%s archives','Include the Featured Image too, even if it does not appear directly in the post content.'=>'Include the Featured Image too, even if it does not appear directly in the post content.','Exclude Posts'=>'Exclude Posts','Enter post IDs of posts you want to exclude from the sitemap, separated by commas. This option **applies** to all posts types including posts, pages, and custom post types.'=>'Enter post IDs of posts you want to exclude from the sitemap, separated by commas. This option **applies** to all post types including posts, pages, and custom post types.','Exclude Terms'=>'Exclude Terms','Add term IDs, separated by comma. This option is applied for all taxonomies.'=>'Add term IDs, separated by a comma. This option is applied for all taxonomies.','Include in Sitemap'=>'Include in Sitemap','Include this post type in the XML sitemap.'=>'Include this post type in the XML sitemap.','Product\'s short description of the current product'=>'Product\'s short description of the current product','Product\'s brand.'=>'Product\'s brand.','Product\'s brand of the current product'=>'Product\'s brand of the current product','Remove base'=>'Remove base','Remove category base'=>'Remove category base','Remove prefix from category URL.'=>'Remove prefix from category URL.','default: /product-category/accessories/action-figures/ - changed: /accessories/action-figures/'=>'default: /product-category/accessories/action-figures/ - changed: /accessories/action-figures/',' Remove parent slugs'=>' Remove parent slugs','Remove parent slugs from category URL.'=>'Remove parent slugs from the category URL.','default: /product-category/accessories/action-figures/ - changed: /product-category/action-figures/'=>'default: /product-category/accessories/action-figures/ - changed: /product-category/action-figures/','Prefix for the breadcrumb path.'=>'Prefix for the breadcrumb path.','Archive Format'=>'Archive Format','Format the label used for archive pages.'=>'Format the label used for archive pages.','Search Results Format'=>'Search Results Format','Format the label used for search results pages.'=>'Format the label used for the search results pages.','404 label'=>'404 label','Label used for 404 error item in breadcrumbs.'=>'Label used for 404 error item in breadcrumbs.','Hide Post Title'=>'Hide Post Title','Hide Post title from Breadcrumb.'=>'Hide Post title from Breadcrumb.','Show Category(s)'=>'Show Category(s)','Add missing TITLE attributes'=>'Add missing TITLE attributes','Add <code>TITLE</code> attribute for all <code>images</code> without a <code>TITLE</code> attribute automatically. The attribute is dynamically applied when the content is displayed, and the stored content is not changed.'=>'Add <code>TITLE</code> attribute for all <code>images</code> without a <code>TITLE</code> attribute automatically. The attribute is dynamically applied when the content is displayed, and the stored content is not changed.','Title attribute format'=>'Title attribute format','Format used for the new <code>title</code> attribute values.'=>'Format used for the new <code>title</code> attribute values.','Remove /category/ from category archive URLs. %s <br>E.g. <code>example.com/category/my-category/</code> becomes <code>example.com/my-category</code>'=>'Remove /category/ from category archive URLs. %s <br>E.g. <code>example.com/category/my-category/</code> becomes <code>example.com/my-category</code>','Why do this?'=>'Why do this?','Redirection Manager'=>'Redirection Manager','Redirections Manager'=>'Redirections Manager','Please enable Redirections module.'=>'Please enable Redirections module.','Redirect Attachments'=>'Redirect Attachments','User-Agent'=>'User-Agent','Hits'=>'Hits','Access Time'=>'Access Time','Hovering over a row in the list will display action links that allow you to manage the item. You can perform the following actions:'=>'Hovering over a row in the list will display action links that allow you to manage the item. You can perform the following actions:','<strong>View Details</strong> shows details about the 404 requests.'=>'<strong>View Details</strong> shows details about the 404 requests.','<strong>Redirect</strong> takes you to the Redirections manager to redirect the 404 URL.'=>'<strong>Redirect</strong> takes you to the Redirections manager to redirect the 404 URL.','<strong>Delete</strong> permanently removes the item from the list.'=>'<strong>Delete</strong> permanently removes the item from the list.','You can also redirect or delete multiple items at once. Selecting multiple items to redirect allows you to redirect them to a single URL.'=>'You can also redirect or delete multiple items at the same time. Selecting multiple items to redirect allows you to redirect them to a single URL.','You can hide/display columns based on your needs.'=>'You can hide/display columns based on your needs.','Using a 302 <em>temporary</em> redirection is useful when you want to test a new page for client feedback temporarily without affecting the SEO scores of the original page.'=>'Using a 302 <em>temporary</em> redirection is useful when you want to test a new page for client feedback temporarily without affecting the SEO scores of the original page.','Redirections can be exported to your .htaccess file for faster redirections, in SEO > Settings > Import/Export.'=>'Redirections can be exported to your .htaccess file for faster redirections, in SEO > Settings > Import/Export.','Add New'=>'Add New','Export to .htaccess'=>'Export to .htaccess','Export to Nginx config file'=>'Export to Nginx config file','Debug Redirections'=>'Debug Redirections','Display the Debug Console instead of being redirected. Administrators only.'=>'Display the Debug Console instead of being redirected. Administrators only.','Fallback Behavior'=>'Fallback Behaviour','Salary Currency'=>'Salary Currency','Monthly'=>'Monthly','Weekly'=>'Weekly','Daily'=>'Daily','Date Posted'=>'Date Posted','Product Price'=>'Product Price','Product In-Stock'=>'Product In Stock','Cuisine'=>'Cuisine','Keywords'=>'Keywords','Recipe Yield'=>'Recipe Yield','Preparation Time'=>'Preparation Time','Cooking Time'=>'Cooking Time','Duration'=>'Duration','Gender'=>'Gender','Not a valid settings founds to delete cache.'=>'There was no valid setting found to delete the cache.','An API Key is required to display embedded Google Maps on your site. Get it here: %s'=>'An API Key is required to display embedded Google Maps on your site. Get it here: %s','Google Maps Embed API'=>'Google Maps Embed API','Geo Coordinates'=>'Geo Coordinates','Latitude and longitude values separated by comma.'=>'Latitude and longitude values separated by a comma.','Start Date'=>'Start Date','End Date'=>'End Date','Ticket URL'=>'Ticket URL','Entry Price'=>'Entry Price','Currency'=>'Currency','Recipe Video Description'=>'Recipe Video Description','Recipe Ingredients'=>'Recipe Ingredients','Fetching in Progress'=>'Fetching in Progress','Data Rows: %s'=>'Data Rows: %s','Unfortunately, the standard WordPress tagline is "Just Another WordPress site."  That\'s pretty sloppy looking, and it does nothing for your SEO.  In fact, it\'s actually a security risk - it makes it easy for hackers with a WordPress exploit to locate your site with an automated search.'=>'Unfortunately, the standard WordPress tagline is "Just Another WordPress site." That\'s pretty sloppy looking, and it does nothing for your SEO. In fact, it\'s actually a security risk - it makes it easy for hackers with a WordPress exploit to locate your site with an automated search.','Changing your tagline is very easy.  Just head on over to <a target="_blank" href="%1$s">Settings - General</a> in WordPress\'s admin menu (on the left), or click on the link in this sentence.'=>'Changing your tagline is very easy. Just head on over to <a target="_blank" href="%1$s">Settings - General</a> in WordPress\'s admin menu (on the left), or click on the link in this sentence.','Permalink Structure'=>'Permalink Structure','For the best SEO results, use a custom permalink structure, preferably one that includes the post title (<code>%%postname%%</code>). You can change it by navigating to <a href="%s">Settings &gt; Permalinks</a>'=>'For the best SEO results, use a custom permalink structure, preferably one that includes the post title (<code>%%postname%%</code>). You can change it by navigating to <a href="%s">Settings &gt; Permalinks</a>','The standard permalink structure is pretty ugly - WordPress generates offputting URLs like: http://www.yoursite.com/?p=99'=>'The standard permalink structure is pretty ugly - WordPress generates offputting URLs like: http://www.yoursite.com/?p=99','It\'s not very kind on the eyes, and it does nothing for your site\'s SEO.  In fact, it can hurt it - Google\'s bot is quite cautious about crawling pages that look auto-generated.'=>'It\'s not very kind on the eyes, and it does nothing for your site\'s SEO. In fact, it can hurt it - Google\'s bot is quite cautious about crawling pages that look auto-generated.','Fortunately, it\'s very easy to fix.  Just hop on over to <a target="_blank" href="%1$s">Settings - Permalinks</a>.  Then chose the "Post Name" option.'=>'Fortunately, it\'s very easy to fix. Just hop on over to <a target="_blank" href="%1$s">Settings - Permalinks</a>. Then choose the "Post Name" option.','This option will replace the "?p=99" part of the URL with the post\'s title, like this: http://www.yoursite.com/my-amazing-post-title/'=>'This option will replace the "?p=99" part of the URL with the post\'s title, like this: http://www.yoursite.com/my-amazing-post-title/','This looks nice for readers - and it gets your keywords into the URL (keywords in the URL is a ranking factor).'=>'This looks nice for readers - and it gets your keywords into the URL (keywords in the URL is a ranking factor).','Focus Keywords'=>'Focus Keywords','Set the sitemap options for author archive pages. %s.'=>'Set the sitemap options for author archive pages. %s.','attachments'=>'attachments','your product pages'=>'your product pages','Image Custom Fields'=>'Image Custom Fields','Insert custom field (post meta) names which contain image URLs to include them in the sitemaps. Add one per line.'=>'Insert custom field (post meta) names which contain image URLs to include them in the sitemaps. Add one per line.','Include archive pages for terms of this taxonomy in the XML sitemap.'=>'Include archive pages for terms of this taxonomy in the XML sitemap.','Include Empty Terms'=>'Include Empty Terms','Include archive pages of terms that have no posts associated.'=>'Include archive pages of terms that have no posts associated.','Product\'s price.'=>'Product\'s price.','Product\'s price of the current product'=>'Product\'s price of the current product','Product\'s SKU.'=>'Product\'s SKU.','Product\'s SKU of the current product'=>'Product\'s SKU of the current product','Product\'s short description.'=>'Product\'s short description.','If category is a child category, show all ancestor categories.'=>'If the category is a child category, show all ancestor categories.','Hide Taxonomy Name'=>'Hide Taxonomy Name','Hide Taxonomy Name from Breadcrumb.'=>'Hide Taxonomy Name from Breadcrumb.','.htaccess file not found.'=>'The .htaccess file was not found.','.htaccess file is not writable.'=>'The .htaccess file is not writable.','I understand the risks and I want to edit the file'=>'I understand the risks and I want to edit the file','Add <code>alt</code> attributes for <code>images</code> without <code>alt</code> attributes automatically. The attribute is dynamically applied when the content is displayed, and the stored content is not changed.'=>'Add <code>alt</code> attributes for <code>images</code> without <code>alt</code> attributes automatically. The attribute is dynamically applied when the content is displayed, and the stored content is not changed.','Be careful when editing the htaccess file, it is easy to make mistakes and break your site. If that happens, you can restore the file to its state <strong>before the last edit</strong> by replacing the htaccess file with the backup copy created by Rank Math in the same directory (<em>.htaccess_back_xxxxxx</em>) using an FTP client.'=>'Be careful when editing the .htaccess file, it is easy to make mistakes and break your site. If that happens, you can restore the file to its state <strong>before the last edit</strong> by replacing the .htaccess file with the backup copy created by Rank Math in the same directory (<em>.htaccess_back_xxxxxx</em>), using an FTP client.','Alt attribute format'=>'Alt attribute format','Format used for the new <code>alt</code> attribute values.'=>'The format used for the new <code>alt</code> attribute values.','Automatically add <code>target="_blank"</code> attribute for external links appearing in your posts, pages, and other post types to make them open in a new browser tab or window. The attribute is dynamically applied when the content is displayed, and the stored content is not changed.'=>'Automatically add <code>target="_blank"</code> attribute for external links appearing in your posts, pages, and other post types to make them open in a new browser tab or window. The attribute is dynamically applied when the content is displayed, and the stored content is not changed.','Usage Tracking'=>'Usage Tracking','RSS Before Content'=>'RSS Before Content','Add content before each post in your site feeds.'=>'Add content before each post in your site feeds.','RSS After Content'=>'RSS After Content','Add content after each post in your site feeds.'=>'Add content after each post in your site feeds.','Available variables'=>'Available variables','Enter your Bing Webmaster Tools verification HTML code or ID. Get it here: %s'=>'Enter your Bing Webmaster Tools verification HTML code or ID. Get it here: %s','Bing Webmaster Verification Page'=>'Bing Webmaster Verification Page','Baidu Webmaster Tools'=>'Baidu Webmaster Tools','Yandex Verification ID'=>'Yandex Verification ID','Yandex.Webmaster Page'=>'Yandex.Webmaster Page','Course Provider'=>'Course Provider','Pages'=>'Pages','Bad request. Please check the code.'=>'Bad request. Please check the code.','Google\'s Search Console is a vital source of information concerning your rankings and click-through rates.  Rank Math can import this data, so you don\'t have to log into your Google account to get the data you need.'=>'Google\'s Search Console is a vital source of information concerning your rankings and click-through rates.  Rank Math can import this data, so you don\'t have to log into your Google account to get the data you need.','You can integrate the Google Search Console with Rank math in the <a href="%1$s" target="_blank">Search Console tab</a>. of Rank Math\'s General Settings menu.'=>'You can integrate the Google Search Console with Rank Math in the <a href="%1$s" target="_blank">Search Console tab</a> of Rank Math\'s General Settings menu.','Read <a href="%1$s" target="_blank">this article</a> for detailed instructions on setting up your Google Webmaster account and getting Rank Math to work with the Google Search Console.'=>'Read <a href="%1$s" target="_blank">this article</a> for detailed instructions on setting up your Google Webmaster account and getting Rank Math to work with the Google Search Console.','XML sitemaps are a special type of text file that tells search engines about the structure of your site. They\'re a list of all the resources (pages and files) you would like the search engine to index. You can assign different priorities, so certain pages will be crawled first. Before XML sitemaps, search engines were limited to indexing the content they could find by following links. That\'s still an important feature for search engine spiders, but XML sitemaps have made it easier for content creators and search engines to collaborate.'=>'XML sitemaps are a special type of text file that tells search engines about the structure of your site. They\'re a list of all the resources (pages and files) you would like the search engine to index. You can assign different priorities, so certain pages will be crawled first. Before XML sitemaps, search engines were limited to indexing the content they could find by following links. That\'s still an important feature for search engine spiders, but XML sitemaps have made it easier for content creators and search engines to collaborate.','If you don\'t have an XML sitemap, the best option is to install a plugin that creates sitemaps for you. That way you\'ll know the sitemap will always be up-to-date. Plugins can also automatically ping the search engines when the XML file is updated. The Rank Math WordPress plugin gives you complete control over your site\'s XML sitemaps. You can control the settings for each page as you write or edit it, and Rank Math will ping Google as soon as you submit your edits. This results in fast crawls and indexing.'=>'If you don\'t have an XML sitemap, the best option is to install a plugin that creates sitemaps for you. That way you\'ll know the sitemap will always be up to date. Plugins can also automatically ping the search engines when the XML file is updated. The Rank Math WordPress plugin gives you complete control over your site\'s XML sitemaps. You can control the settings for each page as you write or edit it, and Rank Math will ping Google as soon as you submit your edits. This results in fast crawls and indexing.','Your Site Tagline is set to the default value <em>Just another WordPress site</em>.'=>'Your Site Tagline is set to the default value <em>Just another WordPress site</em>.','Your Site Tagline is set to a custom value.'=>'Your Site Tagline is set to a custom value.','Permalinks are set to the default value. <em>Pretty permalinks</em> are disabled. '=>'Permalinks are set to the default value. <em>Pretty permalinks</em> are disabled. ','Permalinks are set to a custom structure but the post titles do not appear in the permalinks.'=>'Permalinks are set to a custom structure, but the post titles do not appear in the permalinks.','Post permalink structure is set to %s.'=>'The post permalink structure is set to %s.','Remove Generator Tag'=>'Remove Generator Tag','Remove WooCommerce generator tag from the source code.'=>'Remove the WooCommerce generator tag from the source code.','Enable breadcrumbs function'=>'Enable the breadcrumbs function','Turning off breadcrumbs will hide breadcrumbs inserted in template files too.'=>'Turning off breadcrumbs will hide breadcrumbs inserted in template files too.','Separator character or string that appears between breadcrumb items.'=>'Separator character or string that appears between breadcrumb items.','Show Homepage Link'=>'Show Homepage Link','Display homepage breadcrumb in trail.'=>'Display the homepage breadcrumb in the trail.','Homepage label'=>'Homepage label','Label used for homepage link (first item) in breadcrumbs.'=>'Label used